		{
			dependencies: ["188F5704688C12F8"]
			description: [
				"If you're feeling lost and the Company Brief Chapter was not enough to get you started, this quest is for you.&r"
				"A lot of the quests on this chapter are item quests that serve as clues to help you in making a smooth progress through the pack's objectives. As a themed low tech modpack, C:HK's purpose lies in rewarding automation and problem solving through progressively harder items to produce. "
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"From Chapter 2 on, there will be less and less of these clues and you'll have to think of how to progress by your own means. If you're already experienced with the mods in this pack, this is probably irrelevant."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If you have any feedback, please reach out! All opinions are welcome."
